32474632", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_29271109649141297_7977265845579411909_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ejeuQfGLMEQ7kNvwGo-iTR&_nc_oc=Adq_lbWndFeV8O0l75PigsH2QvaKoF1FPy9tG43idI9LYYgw3kcs9Z8vEbmZL_A_RTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQXtGiCB0w_ltZy1kQQHGa5RBO2Uf5eB9TgUNthWaYHNA&oe=6B086B5E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1088797830417962", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1088797837084628_2030138725379435615_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=64woLnFzw7kQ7kNvwEmxLKk&_nc_oc=AdrSBJVqlWveSnKAadLdzBcvrsJNZbIrmvDSgMFLVI8yu7JihwUmwer0_5UUOg26Hn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-HQLxCbYJ-OoDbxI_LoqbQoUEctCL4vWrtWjBjNQF_Q&oe=6B0842F6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "YadKon VR", "keywords": ["iran", "memorial", "politics"], "long_description": "YadKon VR is the interactive memorial space designed for standalone Meta Quest headsets. Created as an extension of the YadKon registry, this application provides a tranquil environment for visitors around the world to pay tribute, light candles, and preserve the memory of individuals lost during human rights events in Iran.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- **Interactive Memorial Hall**: Walk through a serene, high-fidelity 3D environment dedicated to reflection and honor.\n- **Flower tributes**: Plant flowers in the memorial space of each individual.\n- **Standalone VR Experience**: Runs natively on Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S, and Pro without needing a tethered PC.\n- **6DOF Positional Motion**: Full room-scale navigation with intuitive Touch Controller interactions.\n\nPurpose & Mission:\n\nYadKon serves as a digital monument and historical archive. It offers a respectful, quiet space for family members, international supporters, and human rights advocates to co